   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the municipal home rule law, in relation to the city charter\nreferendum process; and to repeal paragraphs (e), (f) and (g) of subdivision 5\nof section 36 of the municipal home rule law, relating to limitations on the\nsubmitting of a question to the qualified electors of a city when there is a\nquestion submitted by a charter commission",
    "basePrintNo": "S590",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S590-2025",
